Z||000000||Pike||10-08-2001||11:30 PM||||I'd like to thank list member Chris Pond. Chris drove all the way up to the high desert Sunday morning to deliver Switches, Center Console and a new Factory Wing for my 87 GT. The new switches fixed EVERYTHING...even the rear window defogger and the new wing looks awsome! We even got a chance to use the official Fiero Key retrieval device of legendary fame. Chris drove his absolutely georgeous 88 GT. The flawless light cream paint job and caramel interior were awsome, set off by Perfect stock basket rims and Goodyear tires. I have a target now for my own 87 GT project. Thanks Chris...I really appreciate it. <BR>Pike<BR>PS. The pics turned out great, I'd post one or two here if I could figure out how...but I'll be sending you the complete set tomorrow via T-1.<BR>||||reg||1
